    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh ok, i see. i was reading online that some people say you can eat those things as long as you don't overdo it? and honestly im really struggling with my appetite since i started the meds, so i really need the calories/protein from things like feta or even some fermented foods to keep me going. is it really that big of a deal if i just have a little bit of soy sauce or a slice of salami here and there? i'm trying to be balanced.",
